+Mujhe ek Python project banana hai. Pehle ek script banao generate_logs.py jo ek logs.txt file generate kare. Is file mein 10,000 dummy log entries honi chahiye. Format aisa ho: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS - Log Message. Time ko random generate karo aur usko sort karke hi file mein save karo. Baad mein hum is file par Binary Search lagayenge.
